      "content": "That's a good start for the narrative style. For the second paragraph about Mario, could you finish that description? Specifically, focus a bit more on his behavior and how he's interacting with the staff. I want the students to see how different cultural or demographic backgrounds might influence a patient's outward expression of pain or their level of cooperation during an intake assessment. Can you provide a full description of his behavior and how the staff might perceive his demeanor?",
